{
 "summary": "Checkout failed from about 00:20:22Z to 00:21:37Z because inventory POST /reserve became slow right after inventory 3.3.0 was deployed at 00:20:20Z. Orders timed out waiting on inventory and returned 504, and gateway returned 502. Errors stopped around 00:21:36-37Z, just after inventory 3.3.1 was deployed at 00:21:35Z. Metrics show error ratios back at 0 by the end of the window.",
 "root_cause": {
  "statement": "Inventory release 3.3.0, deployed at 00:20:20Z, made POST /reserve slow, with self time of about 2.5-2.8s. Orders timed out reserving inventory and returned 504, which gateway surfaced as 502 on POST /checkout. Inventory itself returned no 5xx; it was slow, not failing. Two things tie the deploy to the failures: symptoms began within seconds of the deploy, and every sampled error trace ran inventory 3.3.0. Symptoms cleared right after 3.3.1 replaced it.",
  "service": "inventory",
  "confidence": "high",
  "evidence_ids": [
   "ev-ebf632945eff",
   "ev-c8dd0e54519d",
   "ev-50374ccf6895",
   "ev-598e61f136b1",
   "ev-cabcf49a9d1c",
   "ev-8d314bc61bf4"
  ]
 },
 "contributing_factors": [
  {
   "statement": "Orders' timeout on inventory calls (traces end at about 2.0s) turns inventory slowness into hard 504 failures, which cascade to gateway 502s.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-c8dd0e54519d",
    "ev-598e61f136b1",
    "ev-c0a0cf40a875"
   ]
  },
  {
   "statement": "Inventory p95 latency peaked at 4.75s while its 5xx ratio stayed at 0%. Inventory's own error metrics would therefore not have flagged the problem.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-50374ccf6895"
   ]
  }
 ],
 "timeline": [
  {
   "time": "2026-10-24T00:20:20Z",
   "event": "Inventory deployed 3.1.5 -> 3.3.0 by ci-pipeline.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-ebf632945eff"
   ]
  },
  {
   "time": "2026-10-24T00:20:22Z",
   "event": "Orders starts logging 'timed out reserving inventory' and gateway starts logging 'checkout failed: orders returned 504'.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-598e61f136b1",
    "ev-cabcf49a9d1c"
   ]
  },
  {
   "time": "2026-10-24T00:20:34Z",
   "event": "Gateway 5xx ratio crosses 5% and p95 crosses 1s; inventory p95 crosses 1s.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-616be7148a2c",
    "ev-50374ccf6895"
   ]
  },
  {
   "time": "2026-10-24T00:20:49Z",
   "event": "Orders 5xx ratio crosses 5% and p95 crosses 1s.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-c0a0cf40a875"
   ]
  },
  {
   "time": "2026-10-24T00:21:20Z",
   "event": "Sampled error traces (00:21:20-00:21:34) show most self time in inventory POST /reserve on 3.3.0.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-c8dd0e54519d"
   ]
  },
  {
   "time": "2026-10-24T00:21:35Z",
   "event": "Inventory deployed 3.3.0 -> 3.3.1.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-8d314bc61bf4"
   ]
  },
  {
   "time": "2026-10-24T00:21:37Z",
   "event": "Last gateway checkout-failure log; error ratios end the window at 0.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-cabcf49a9d1c",
    "ev-598e61f136b1",
    "ev-616be7148a2c",
    "ev-c0a0cf40a875"
   ]
  }
 ],
 "ruled_out": [
  {
   "statement": "Gateway and orders are not the origin. They report the errors, but trace self time is dominated by inventory POST /reserve. Their releases (1.4.2 and 2.7.0) had no deploy records in the window.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-c8dd0e54519d",
    "ev-cabcf49a9d1c",
    "ev-598e61f136b1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "statement": "A traffic surge is unlikely. Gateway request rate stayed flat at about 2.0 req/s (max 2.3).",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-616be7148a2c"
   ]
  }
 ],
 "unknowns": [
  "What change in inventory 3.3.0 slowed POST /reserve (code, queries, or downstream dependency) is not visible in the evidence; no inventory logs were provided.",
  "It is not confirmed that 3.3.1 is a fix rather than coincidental timing; no post-3.3.1 traces are included, though end-of-window metrics show recovery.",
  "Whether partially completed reservations or orders were left inconsistent by the timeouts is unknown."
 ],
 "recommended_actions": [
  {
   "action": "Keep inventory on 3.3.1 and do not roll back to 3.3.0; confirm 3.3.1 includes the fix for POST /reserve latency.",
   "rationale": "Failures began with 3.3.0 and stopped right after 3.3.1 was deployed.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-ebf632945eff",
    "ev-8d314bc61bf4",
    "ev-c8dd0e54519d"
   ]
  },
  {
   "action": "Diff inventory 3.1.5 vs 3.3.0 for the POST /reserve path and review example traces f34021a01b6f4d3645cd5484d3cec7a8 and ea63b503027545474adfad9cd1223129.",
   "rationale": "These traces show inventory self time of about 2.5s on 3.3.0.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-c8dd0e54519d"
   ]
  },
  {
   "action": "Audit orders and reservations created between 00:20:20Z and 00:21:37Z for inconsistent state.",
   "rationale": "There were 126 timeout errors while inventory may still have been processing the reserve calls.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-598e61f136b1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "action": "Add latency-based alerting on inventory POST /reserve and a canary or latency gate for inventory deploys.",
   "rationale": "Inventory showed no 5xx during the incident, only latency up to 4.75s p95.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-50374ccf6895"
   ]
  }
 ]
}
